==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Gossifleur|20}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion; both cards have the Razor Leaf attack.
*{{m|Razor Leaf}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gossifleur}} can learn.
